rong style=\"color: #1f4f49;\">not on the list</strong> but earned Affiliate commissions in September, please visit the event page and click the <strong style=\"color: #1f4f49;\">Reward Information</strong> button to add your reward details.</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><strong style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">The Organizers and Sword of Justice will NEVER ask you for your password, OTP or transaction verification code to receive rewards. Please</strong> stay alert to any fake messages or calls.</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Accounts that violate the terms of service, use cheating tools or create fake recruits to exploit commissions will be disqualified and have their rewards revoked (if already paid).</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">For any questions, please contact Sword of Justice Customer Support (hotline 1900 561 558) or the official fanpage for help. In the event of any dispute, the final decision rests with the Sword of Justice<strong style=\"color: #1f4f49;\"></strong> Organizers.</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0;\">Wishing you a martial journey full of luck!</p>\n</div>\n<hr style=\"border:0;height:1px;margin:22px auto;max-width:70%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#8fd8c7,transparent);\">\n<style>\n  .download-group { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 16px 0; }\n  .download-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }\n  .download-group a { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 12px; transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease; }\n  .download-group img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; transition: transform 0.25s ease; }\n  .download-group a:hover { transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0px 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25); }\n  .download-group a:hover img { transform: scale(1.05); }\n  .btn-store { width: 300px; }\n  .btn-pc { width: 220px; }\n  @media (max-width: 640